---
// Solution section — feature showcases
---

<section class="w-full bg-bg-base py-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-h1 text-slate-dark text-center mb-16 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            Minimalismo funcional diseñado para no equivocarse.
        </h2>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-20">
            <!-- Feature 1: Sincronización Bidireccional -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center">
                <div class="order-2 md:order-1 flex justify-center">
                    <div
                        class="bg-surface border border-border-div rounded-card p-6 shadow-custom w-full max-w-sm flex flex-col gap-6 items-center"
                    >
                        <div
                            class="flex items-center gap-4 w-full justify-between"
                        >
                            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
                                <div
                                    class="w-12 h-12 rounded-card bg-bg-base border border-border-div flex items-center justify-center text-slate-dark"
                                >
                                    <!-- store icon -->
                                    <svg
                                        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                        width="24"
                                        height="24"
                                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                        fill="none"
                                        stroke="currentColor"
                                        stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round"
                                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                                        ><path
                                            d="m2 7 4.41-4.41A2 2 0 0 1 7.83 2h8.34a2 2 0 0 1 1.42.59L22 7"
                                        ></path><path
                                            d="M4 12v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-8"
                                        ></path><path
                                            d="M15 22v-4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4"
                                        ></path><path d="M2 7h20"></path><path
                                            d="M22 7v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 16 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 12 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 8 12a2.7 2.7 0 0 1-1.59-.63.7.7 0 0 0-.82 0A2.7 2.7 0 0 1 4 12a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V7"
                                        ></path></svg
                                    >
                                </div>
                                <span class="text-label text-slate-label"
                                    >Local Físico</span
                                >
                            </div>
                            <!-- arrow-right-left icon -->
                            <svg
                                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                width="24"
                                height="24"
                                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                fill="none"
                                stroke="currentColor"
                                stroke-width="2"
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                class="text-brand"
                                ><path d="m16 3 4 4-4 4"></path><path
                                    d="M20 7H4"></path><path d="m8 21-4-4 4-4"
                                ></path><path d="M4 17h16"></path></svg
                            >
                            <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2">
                                <div
                                    class="w-12 h-12 rounded-card bg-brand text-white flex items-center justify-center"
                                >
                                    <!-- cloud icon -->
                                    <svg
                                        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                        width="24"
                                        height="24"
                                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                        fill="none"
                                        stroke="currentColor"
                                        stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round"
                                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                                        ><path
                                            d="M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z"
                                        ></path></svg
                                    >
                                </div>
                                <span class="text-label text-slate-label"
                                    >Tiendanube</span
                                >
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div
                            class="w-full bg-success/10 text-success text-label text-center py-2 rounded-btn"
                        >
                            Actualizado en segundos
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
                    <h3 class="text-h2 text-slate-dark mb-3">
                        Sincronización Bidireccional
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-body">
                        Registras una venta física en el Punto de Venta de
                        NexoStock y automáticamente se actualiza tu inventario
                        en Tiendanube. Sin demoras, sin fricciones.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Feature 2: Depósitos Virtuales -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-h2 text-slate-dark mb-3">
                        Depósitos Virtuales
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-body">
                        Vende stock que aún no tienes físicamente con nuestro
                        sistema de "Stock Imaginario". Permite a tus clientes
                        comprar bajo demanda sin desordenar la contabilidad de
                        tu local real.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-center">
                    <div
                        class="bg-surface border border-border-div rounded-card p-6 shadow-custom w-full max-w-sm"
                    >
                        <div
                            class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4 pb-4 border-b border-border-div"
                        >
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                                <div
                                    class="w-10 h-10 rounded-btn bg-bg-base flex items-center justify-center text-slate-dark"
                                >
                                    <!-- package icon -->
                                    <svg
                                        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                        width="20"
                                        height="20"
                                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                        fill="none"
                                        stroke="currentColor"
                                        stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round"
                                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                                        ><path d="m7.5 4.27 9 5.15"></path><path
                                            d="M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z"
                                        ></path><path d="m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5"
                                        ></path><path d="M12 22V12"></path></svg
                                    >
                                </div>
                                <div class="flex flex-col">
                                    <span
                                        class="text-body text-slate-dark font-medium"
                                        >Buzo Premium</span
                                    >
                                    <span class="text-label text-slate-label"
                                        >SKU: BZ-001</span
                                    >
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <span
                                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-virtual-bg text-virtual-text px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[12px] font-medium border border-[#FDE68A]"
                            >
                                <!-- box icon -->
                                <svg
                                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                    width="14"
                                    height="14"
                                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                    fill="none"
                                    stroke="currentColor"
                                    stroke-width="2"
                                    stroke-linecap="round"
                                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                                    ><path
                                        d="M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z"
                                    ></path><path d="m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5"
                                    ></path><path d="M12 22V12"></path></svg
                                >
                                Depósito Virtual
                            </span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex justify-between text-label">
                            <span class="text-slate-label">Stock Asignado:</span
                            >
                            <span class="text-slate-dark font-medium"
                                >50 unidades</span
                            >
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Feature 3: A prueba de errores -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center">
                <div class="order-2 md:order-1 flex justify-center">
                    <div
                        class="bg-surface border border-border-div rounded-card shadow-custom w-full max-w-sm overflow-hidden"
                    >
                        <div
                            class="p-4 border-b border-border-div bg-bg-base flex justify-between items-center"
                        >
                            <span class="text-label text-slate-dark font-medium"
                                >Nueva Venta Rápida</span
                            >
                            <button
                                class="text-danger hover:bg-danger/10 p-1 rounded-btn transition-colors"
                            >
                                <!-- x icon -->
                                <svg
                                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                    width="16"
                                    height="16"
                                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                    fill="none"
                                    stroke="currentColor"
                                    stroke-width="2"
                                    stroke-linecap="round"
                                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                                    ><path d="M18 6 6 18"></path><path
                                        d="m6 6 12 12"></path></svg
                                >
                            </button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="p-6 flex flex-col gap-4">
                            <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
                                <label class="text-label text-slate-label"
                                    >Código de Barras / SKU</label
                                >
                                <div
                                    class="w-full border border-border-div rounded-btn p-2 flex items-center gap-2 bg-surface"
                                >
                                    <!-- scan-line icon -->
                                    <svg
                                        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                        width="16"
                                        height="16"
                                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                        fill="none"
                                        stroke="currentColor"
                                        stroke-width="2"
                                        stroke-linecap="round"
                                        stroke-linejoin="round"
                                        class="text-slate-label"
                                        ><path d="M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"
                                        ></path><path
                                            d="M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"
                                        ></path><path
                                            d="M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"
                                        ></path><path
                                            d="M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2"
                                        ></path><path d="M7 12h10"></path></svg
                                    >
                                    <span class="text-body text-slate-light"
                                        >Ingresar producto...</span
                                    >
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <button
                                class="w-full bg-brand text-white py-2 rounded-btn text-body font-medium mt-2 opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed"
                                >Cobrar e impactar stock</button
                            >
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="order-1 md:order-2">
                    <h3 class="text-h2 text-slate-dark mb-3">
                        A prueba de errores
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-body">
                        Interfaz ultra limpia, libre de distracciones. Diseñada
                        específicamente para que tus vendedores aprendan a
                        cobrar y gestionar el stock en menos de 10 minutos,
                        evitando errores humanos.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
